<title>TURKEY: SOCCER-TRABZONSPOR MOVE IN FOR REKDAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TRABZONSPOR MOVE IN FOR REKDAL.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish club Trabzonspor have made an offer to French club Rennes for Norwegian international midfielder Kjetil Rekdal, according to reports in the Turkish press on Tuesday.</p>
<p>No details of the offer have been made public and, according to a spokesman at Rennes, nothing has been signed.</p>
